    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "This site houses sample data and code for the publication,\r\n\r\nTakemura H, Caiafa CF, Wandell BA, Pestilli F (2016) Ensemble Tractography. PLoS Comput Biol 12(2): e1004692. doi:10.1371/journal.pcbi.1004692\r\n\r\nAll code in this repository is written in MATLAB (Mathworks) and, together with the included data, can be used to reproduce several of the figures from the publication.\r\n\r\nCode and data are provided as part of the goal of ensuring that computational methods are reproducible by other researchers.\r\n\r\nNote: This version of the repository is still under progress, and does not include the LiFE and ET code in the newest release. We are also preparing the GitHub repository for hosting the updated version of the script for reproducing the figure on this paper.\r\n\r\nGithub repository (still under private, but will be available for public upon the publication)\r\nhttps://github.com/vistalab/EnsembleTractography",
            "type": "abstract",
            "identifier": [],
            "note": [],
            "appliesTo": []
        },
